<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Utico year earnings, dividend jump.</title>
<headline>Utico year earnings, dividend jump.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     344	   vs 261</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 172	   vs 122</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   20.92	 vs 15.83</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   33.65	 vs 25.73</p>
<p>    Tax			 12.73	 vs 9.89</p>
<p>    Interest received     5.55	  vs 8.71</p>
<p>    Turnover		  397.98	vs 371.46</p>
<p>Full name: Utico Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - Tobacco group Utico said turnover had grown despite higher excise duties, increased illegal imports and a slowdown in economic growth. The dividend proposal will be put to the annual meeting on March 27.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
